01:11:30,000 --> 01:11:36,000
The Sacrament is a 2013 American found footage horror
film written and directed by Ti West.

14
01:17:00,000 --> 01:17:06,000
Bowen and Joe Swanberg play VICE journalists who document their co-worker's (Kentucker Audley)
attempt to locate his sister (Amy Seimetz) after she joins a reclusive religious commune.

15
01:22:30,000 --> 01:22:36,000
The film's plot is inspired by the real-life events
of the Jonestown Massacre of 1978.

16
01:28:00,000 --> 01:28:06,000
The film explores themes of journalist, poison,
lethal injection, interview, cult.

17
01:33:30,000 --> 01:33:36,000
The tone is intense and dark and mind_bending.
